DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/users/{user_id}/mfa_authenticators/{authenticator_id}
Deletes a specific MFA device, including a PIV key or FIDO2 key enrollment, for a user. This action is only available if MFA is turned on for the organization. Successful deletion revokes the enrollment and returns a null result.
Required: user_id (path); account_id (path); authenticator_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/users/{user_id}
Deletes a specific user for an account. This will also revoke any active seats and tokens for the user.
Required: user_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/users/{user_id}/active_sessions/{nonce}
Get an active session for a single user.
Required: user_id (path); account_id (path); nonce (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/users/{user_id}
Gets a specific user for an account.
Required: user_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/users/{user_id}
Updates a specific user's name for an account. Requires the user's current email as confirmation (email cannot be changed).
Required: user_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
